      "statement_id": "N-S109-1",
      "normative_level": "SHOULD",
      "category": "BEHAVIORAL",
      "subject": "server",
      "stage": "imap_fsm",
      "description": "If the domain of the decoded data is \"8bit\" and the data does not contain the NUL octet, the server SHOULD return the data in a <string> instead of a <literal8>; this allows the client to determine if the \"8bit\" data contains the NUL octet without having to explicitly scan the data stream for NULs.",
