      "subject": "server",
      "stage": "imap_fsm",
      "description": "When sending data in a BINARY[...] FETCH data item, servers MUST ensure that textual line-oriented sections are always transmitted using the IMAP CRLF line termination syntax, regardless of the underlying storage representation of the data on the server.",
